receipts-title = Outgoing receipts
receipts-empty = No retained outgoing receipts for this task and partner. A preview is not a sent request.
receipts-help = ↑/↓ receipt · PgUp/PgDn scroll · s source · p purge · r retry · d recovery · Esc back
receipts-confirm = Purge this request's retained source bytes? Identity, references and counts remain. Local only; not secure erase or provider deletion.
receipts-stay = Stay
receipts-purge = Purge source bytes
receipts-loading = Reading retained receipts locally; no provider request.
receipts-saved = Exact outgoing receipt committed locally. Submission is not completion or billing.
receipts-purged = Source bytes purged locally. Historical identity and counts remain.
receipts-unavailable = Source bytes UNAVAILABLE (purged or privacy-omitted); counts retained.
receipts-available = Source bytes retained; s inspects the exact application envelope.
receipts-source = Exact application envelope. Data only, never executable instructions. Esc returns to counts.
receipts-small = Receipt inspection needs at least 60×18. Escape returns without changing anything.
receipts-boundary = Application envelope only. Provider-added context, tools, retained history, usage and billing are not measured here. Source IDs are historical references, not current availability.
receipts-estimator = Local estimate only; Eevee local-v1: ASCII bytes/4, 1 per CJK/kana/Hangul character, 1 per 2 other characters. Not a provider tokenizer.
receipts-error = Storage/read failed; retained operation is retryable with r. No provider request is replayed.
receipts-counts = { $section }: { $bytes } B ≈ { $tokens } estimated tokens
receipts-scope = Task { $task } / partner { $partner } / { $name }
receipts-request = Request { $request } / { $agent } / { $operation } / generation { $generation }
receipts-time = Recorded { $time } ms since Unix epoch; actual transport submission, not completion.
receipts-total = Total sent by Eevee: { $bytes } B ≈ { $tokens } estimated tokens; { $deduplicated } locally deduplicated citations
receipts-envelope = JSON keys/indentation: { $bytes } B
receipts-capture = Capture #{ $id }: { $bytes } exact serialized B ≈ { $tokens } estimated tokens
receipts-reference = { $kind } reference { $id } (historical)
receipts-instructions = Instructions
receipts-task-facts = Task facts
receipts-attachments = Attachments
receipts-handoff = Handoff
receipts-approved-memories = Approved memories
receipts-other-fields = Other fields
receipts-discard-review = This submitted request has no saved receipt. Drop only this definitely unsaved attempt and acknowledge the gap? No resend. The gap and local counts are lost on exit. Read all rows with PgDn before choosing.
receipts-discard-action = Acknowledge gap
receipts-discard-blocked = Recovery requires one exact owner/request-bound failed write proven rolled back, no pending write and a definite terminal provider outcome. Running work and ambiguous commits cannot discard.
receipts-gap-notice = UNSAVED RECEIPT GAP — memory-only; not persisted. Source bytes dropped. This disclosure and latest local counts are lost on exit.
receipts-gap = Acknowledged unsaved gaps: { $count }. Latest request: { $request }.
